sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User (Voice)
    participant A as Alexa+
    participant M as MCP Server
    participant DB as Memory Graph DB
    participant AI as Bedrock Sonnet
    participant D as Dashboard SSE

    U->>A: "Where are my glasses?"
    A->>M: tool_call: get_entity_context("glasses")
    M->>DB: SELECT 2-hop neighborhood
    Note over DB: < 30ms SQL query
    DB-->>M: {located_in: "Living Room Table", updated: "2h ago"}
    M-->>A: structured JSON response
    A-->>U: "Your glasses are on the living room table."

    Note over M,AI: Async / background path
    M->>AI: analyze_context(subgraph JSON)
    AI-->>DB: INSERT action_audit_logs (thinking, output)
    AI-->>D: SSE: graph_updated event
    D-->>D: Animate node highlight on dashboard
